   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"n\"></span> percent, denoted <span data-math=\"n\\% \"></span>, is the fraction <span data-math=\"\\frac{n}{{100}}.\"></span></p>\n<p>70 is what percentage of 1,000?</p>\n<p>Rewrite “is” as equals and “percentage of” as <span data-math=\"\\frac{n}{{100}} \\times 1,000.\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"70 = \\frac{n}{{100}} \\times 1,000\"></span></p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"70 = 10n\"></span></td>\n<td>Divide by 10.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"7 = n\"></span></p>\n<p>The answer is 7%.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "7%"
    }
   ],
