     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"n\"></span> percent, denoted <span data-math=\"n\\% \"></span>, is the fraction <span data-math=\"\\frac{n}{{100}}.\"></span></p>\n<p>425 is what percentage of 500?</p>\n<p>Rewrite “is” as equals and “percentage of” as <span data-math=\"\\frac{n}{{100}} \\times 500.\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"425 = \\frac{n}{{100}} \\times 500\"></span></p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"425 = 5n\"></span></td>\n<td>Divide by 5.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"85 = n\"></span></p>\n<p>The answer is 85%.</p>"
